    "detailed_description": "This VR game puts you in the shoes of a doctor at nanoscale to fight infections by shooting viruses while preserving red and white blood cells.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378780/extras/4487da021f6bee5657b7b2653bd04efe.poster.avif?t=1612715503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378780/extras/4487da021f6bee5657b7b2653bd04efe.webm?t=1612715503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378780/extras/4487da021f6bee5657b7b2653bd04efe.mp4?t=1612715503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Improve your VR aiming</strong> : Precise shooter with scoring<br></li><li><strong>Cure the disease</strong> : Multiple stage with different song, rythm and diseases to cure ! <br></li><li><strong>Feel the heartbeat</strong> : All motions are in sync with the music !<br></li><li><strong>Multiple weapons, equipments and bonus</strong> : and more to come during early access !<br></li><li><strong>Global Leaderboards</strong> : Compete against other nano doctors around the world ! <br></li><li><strong>Statistics and Trophies</strong> : Improve your shooting skill </li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378780/extras/0c76b5fbd17018b254a5234a148a1457.poster.avif?t=1612715503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378780/extras/0c76b5fbd17018b254a5234a148a1457.webm?t=1612715503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378780/extras/0c76b5fbd17018b254a5234a148a1457.mp4?t=1612715503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Other Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>LIV integration</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378780/extras/1c1173ae8b0031ef47ee6a35689a75f2.poster.avif?t=1612715503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378780/extras/1c1173ae8b0031ef47ee6a35689a75f2.webm?t=1612715503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378780/extras/1c1173ae8b0031ef47ee6a35689a75f2.mp4?t=1612715503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "This VR game puts you in the shoes of a doctor at nanoscale to fight infections by shooting viruses while preserving red and white blood cells.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378780/extras/4487da021f6bee5657b7b2653bd04efe.poster.avif?t=1612715503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378780/extras/4487da021f6bee5657b7b2653bd04efe.webm?t=1612715503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378780/extras/4487da021f6bee5657b7b2653bd04efe.mp4?t=1612715503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Improve your VR aiming</strong> : Precise shooter with scoring<br></li><li><strong>Cure the disease</strong> : Multiple stage with different song, rythm and diseases to cure ! <br></li><li><strong>Feel the heartbeat</strong> : All motions are in sync with the music !<br></li><li><strong>Multiple weapons, equipments and bonus</strong> : and more to come during early access !<br></li><li><strong>Global Leaderboards</strong> : Compete against other nano doctors around the world ! <br></li><li><strong>Statistics and Trophies</strong> : Improve your shooting skill </li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378780/extras/0c76b5fbd17018b254a5234a148a1457.poster.avif?t=1612715503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378780/extras/0c76b5fbd17018b254a5234a148a1457.webm?t=1612715503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378780/extras/0c76b5fbd17018b254a5234a148a1457.mp4?t=1612715503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video